    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a patch with stochastic Gaussian influence. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_random_gaussian_patch" kindref="compound">RandomGaussianPatch</ref> class is a concrete implementation of <ref refid="class_patch_shape" kindref="compound">PatchShape</ref>. The patch influence follows a Gaussian distribution but includes random variability, making it useful for modeling heterogeneous environmental effects. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
